Role.description_en:
Role permission assigned to the account for this database.  
For MySQL mode, roles are defined at the database level and include the following types:  
ReadWrite: read-write permission, including ALL PRIVILEGES;  
ReadOnly: read-only permission, including SELECT;  
DDL: DDL permission, including CREATE, DROP, ALTER, SHOW VIEW, CREATE VIEW;  
DML: DML permission, including SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, SHOW VIEW.
